{"step_index":184,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:47:32Z","input_tokens":2528,"cache_read_tokens":167016,"output_tokens":762,"thinking":"Current background lacks personality and fails to connect with the gym context, appearing generic and uninspired. Explore background options that evoke a gym atmosphere while remaining aesthetically pleasing. Consider textures, colors, and imagery that resonate with fitness and well-being.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"Add-Type -AssemblyName System.Drawing\\n\\n$images = @(\\n    \\\"gym-dumbbell-background.jpg\\\",\\n    \\\"dumbbell_widescreen_test.jpg\\\",\\n    \\\"wide_dumbbell_seamless.jpg\\\",\\n    \\\"modal-gym-bg-hd.jpg\\\",\\n    \\\"LEGENDS\\\\src\\\\assets\\\\modal-gym-bg.jpg\\\",\\n    \\\"LEGENDS\\\\src\\\\assets\\\\web-gym-weights.jpg\\\",\\n    \\\"LEGENDS\\\\src\\\\assets\\\\gym-background-club-perfect.jpg\\\"\\n)\\n\\nforeach ($imgName in $images) {\\n    if (Test-Path $imgName) {\\n        $img = [System.Drawing.Image]::FromFile((Resolve-Path $imgName))\\n        Write-Host \\\"$imgName -> $($img.Width)x$($img.Height)\\\"\\n        $img.Dispose()\\n    }\\n}\\n\"","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\andre\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\279814bc-a71e-40e6-a8e9-27fbecb5de6c\\\\scratch\\\\check_bg_images.ps1\""}}]}
